      "title": "wsutil: Switch away from G_MODULE_SUFFIX and g_module_build_path",
      "message": "wsutil: Switch away from G_MODULE_SUFFIX and g_module_build_path\n\nGLib 2.76 deprecated G_MODULE_SUFFIX, so just use \".dll\" on Windows and\n\".so\" elsewhere. It also deprecated g_module_build_path, so just use\ng_strconcat.\n\nws_module_open was only used to open wpcap.dll, so rename it to\nload_wpcap_module.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2023-04-07T16:43:19.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2023-04-11T22:54:27.000+00:00",
